=== intro

A figure approaches at the docking bay. Eyes darting. Voice low.

"I have cargo. Good cargo. Need to move it fast—my ship's impounded and I'm leaving on the next shuttle. Half the market rate. No questions."

They're nervous, but the crates look legitimate.

* [Accept the deal]
  ~ credits -= 25
  ~ addCard cargo_processed_metals
  ~ addCard cargo_processed_metals
  ~ chronicle "Opportunistic Purchase"
    Acquired cargo at well below market rate. The seller's desperation was our opportunity.
  -> END

* [Ask what they're running from]
  -> backstory

* [Decline—too risky]
  ~ chronicle "Caution Prevails"
    Turned down a suspicious deal. Better safe than sorry.
  -> END

=== backstory

Their composure cracks. "Debt collectors. Consortium-backed. The kind that take fingers."

A glance over their shoulder. "Please. I just need to be gone."

* [Buy the cargo and offer passage]
  ~ credits -= 25
  ~ supplies -= 3
  ~ morale += 5
  ~ addCard cargo_processed_metals
  ~ addCard cargo_processed_metals
  ~ addCard crew_stowaway
  ~ chronicle "Mercy in the Margins"
    Helped someone escape their debts. Another soul joins the hold. The Consortium won't be pleased.
  -> END

* [Just buy the cargo]
  ~ credits -= 25
  ~ addCard cargo_processed_metals
  ~ addCard cargo_processed_metals
  ~ chronicle "Business Only"
    Took the deal. Left the seller to their fate. Credits don't have memories.
  -> END

* [Walk away]
  -> END
